        "Managed services must use main TCP 47479. Managed service discovery must use dedicated UDP 47478 and shared LAN UDP 47474 on all hosts; reject other installer values before mutation. Preserve mesh identity, credentials, custody data and service configuration during updates. macOS local-build updates must retain the installed code-signing identifier and verify the staged signature before replacement; publisher-issued signatures remain intact. See docs/post-office-macos-service.md. Validate real service restart, LAN multicast and routed discovery on the affected host; fixture tests and listener checks do not establish local-network access. Interface handoff changes require the opt-in Docker network-namespace harness: queued and new messages must converge with authenticated receipts without process restart or manual rescan; namespace evidence is separate from physical Wi-Fi hardware."
      ]
